UnitVotingEscrow::IsAuthorized
├── when the spender is the owner
│   └── it should return true
├── when the spender is an approved operator
│   └── it should return true
├── when the spender is the per token approved address
│   └── it should return true
├── when the spender is unrelated
│   └── it should return false
└── when the token has not been minted
    └── it should return false
